# Classroom Context

#### This is the fifth unit of the course, building off the content from units one through three. The course was designed to teach in order.

#### Teachers serve as guides supporting **design thinking, encouraging responsible AI use, and helping students interpret and improve AI-generated work**.

<div style="display: flex; align-items: center; border: 2px solid black; border-radius: 20px; padding: 20px 10px; margin: 20px 0;">

    
